namespace: molecular_function
def: "Catalysis of the reaction: 1,2-diacyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphocholine + ceramide = 1,2-diacyl-sn-glycerol + sphingomyelin." [EC:2.7.8.27, RHEA:18765]
