xref: Reactome:R-HSA-9843121 "MLL4-ASCOM, (MLL3-ASCOM) complex monomethylates nucleosomes at PPARG:RXRA-bound enhancers"
xref: Reactome:R-HSA-9909628 "Trimethylation of CD274 gene chromatin by MLL1/3 complex"
