def: "The series of molecular signals mediated by hypoxia-inducible factor (HIF1) in response to lowered oxygen levels (hypoxia). Under hypoxic conditions, the oxygen-sensitive alpha-subunit of hypoxia-inducible factor (HIF)-1 dimerizes with a HIF1-beta subunit (also called ARNT or aryl-hydrocarbon-receptor nuclear translocator), translocates to the nucleus and activates transcription of genes whose products participate in responding to hypoxia." [GOC:bf, GOC:jc, PMID:16887934, PMID:26579469]
synonym: "HIF1alpha pathway" EXACT []
synonym: "hypoxia-inducible factor signaling" EXACT [GOC:bf]
synonym: "hypoxia-inducible factor-1alpha signalling pathway" EXACT []
