comment: This complex is related to GO:0070937 CRD-mediated mRNA stability complex but binds the major protein-coding-region determinant of instability (mCRD) domain rather than the CRD. Experimentally it has been shown to act on c-FOS mRNA while GO:0070937 acts on c-MYC mRNA.
