id: GO:0120337
name: radial spoke head 2
namespace: cellular_component
def: "The portion of the radial spoke 2 that is orthogonal to the elongated stalk and which projects towards the central pair of microtubules within the ciliary axoneme." [GOC:krc, PMID:22754630, PMID:348711799]
synonym: "radial spokehead 2" EXACT []
is_a: GO:0001535 ! radial spoke head
relationship: part_of GO:0120334 ! radial spoke 2

