comment: The catalytic activities of the individual components of this complex are represented by the molecular function terms '3-methyl-2-oxobutanoate dehydrogenase (2-methylpropanoyl-transferring) activity ; GO:0003863' (E1), 'dihydrolipoyllysine-residue (2-methylpropanoyl)transferase activity ; GO:0043754' (E2), and 'dihydrolipoyl dehydrogenase activity ; GO:0004148' (E3).
