[Term]
id: GO:7770013
name: humanin receptor complex
namespace: cellular_component
def: "A protein complex that acts as a receptor for the neuroprotective peptide humanin (HN). In humans the receptor complex is a trimer composed of CNTFR, IL6ST and IL27RA. HN binding to IL27RA and CNTFR induces oligomerization of the three subunits." [PMID:19386761]
